<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Astyages</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Astyages was the last king of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/median-empire">Median Empire</a> in the sixth century BCE. According to tradition he was the grandfather of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cyrus-the-great">Cyrus the Great</a>, who revolted against him. Cyrus's victory over Astyages around 550 BCE ended the Median Empire and marked the foundation of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/achaemenid-empire">Achaemenid Empire</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/astyages.jpg" alt="Astyages" width="210" height="420" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Designed by Maximilien de Haese, Woven by Jac. van der Borght (1771-1775) · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:King_Astyages_submitting_to_Cyrus.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
